---
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout description="Olabode Anise builds data and AI systems and writes about security, technology, and making complex tools easier to understand.">
  <PageHero title="A builder who crafts end-to-end solutions and tells stories with data." />

  <section class="site-container pb-20">
    <div class="grid gap-7 text-lg leading-8 text-[var(--color-primary-muted)]">
      <p>
        <strong class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)]">Hi, I’m Olabode (O-lah-boh-dey) Anise (Uh-nee-shey) &#128075; </strong><br />
        I'm based out of San Francisco. I currently work on agentic coding solutions as a Data Scientist at OpenAI.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)]">I’m a Data Scientist who enjoys building for others.</strong><br />
        I pride myself on being a Data Scientist who builds products and platforms for customers and teammates.
        I get joy from landing changes in production and seeing something I helped build solve a real problem.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)]">I care about work that makes technology more accessible and easy to understand.</strong><br />
        From graduate school to now, my career has focused on making it easier for everyone to take advantage of new and complex technologies, whether in
        design, security, or AI.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)]">Outside of work, I spend time reading, traveling, and watching sports.</strong><br />
        The Steelers, Auburn Tigers, and Phoenix Suns have brought me a lot of joy and also taken years off my life.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
